      "id": "e0ef8ae9",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "e0ef8ae9"
      },
      "source": [
        "As a first experiment, let's see how the sample mean and sample median behave as the sample size increases.\n",
        "We'll use the NumPy function `logspace` to make a range of `ns` from 10 to 100,000, equally spaced on a logarithmic scale."
