    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "39d5088f",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "39d5088f"
      },
      "source": [
        "A statistic, like the sample mean or median, that's used to estimate a property of a population is called an **estimator**.\n",
        "\n",
        "The following figure shows how these estimators behave as we increase the sample size.\n",
        "The horizontal line shows the actual mean in the population."
      ]
    },
    {
