      },
      "source": [
        "## Standard Error\n",
        "\n",
        "To quantify the width of the sampling distribution, one option is to compute its standard deviation -- the result is called the **standard error**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 134,
      "id": "4b77e337",
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-16T17:42:04.314836Z",
