    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "dc4e01ef",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dc4e01ef"
      },
      "source": [
        "Standard deviation tells you how much penguins differ in weight.\n",
        "Standard error tells you how precise an estimate is.\n",
        "They are answers to different questions.\n",
        "\n",
        "However, there is a relationship between them.\n",
        "If we know the standard deviation and sample size, we can approximate the standard error of the means like this:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 137,
      "id": "45c4bd4a",
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-16T17:42:04.331696Z",
          "iopub.status.busy": "2026-09-16T17:42:04.331495Z",
          "iopub.status.idle": "2026-09-16T17:42:04.334457Z",
          "shell.execute_reply": "2026-09-16T17:42:04.333668Z"
        },
        "id": "45c4bd4a"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def approximate_standard_error(sample):\n",
        "    n = len(sample)\n",
        "    return np.std(sample) / np.sqrt(n)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 138,
      "id": "1b5f527d",
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-16T17:42:04.336345Z",
